Recommends: python3-nautilus (>= 4.0)
Description: Windows-to-Linux experience compatibility layer
 Trier Bridge gives Windows users a familiar place for the things they
 already know how to do on Linux. It runs entirely as the signed-in user,
 uses the desktop's own extension points, and never installs a daemon,
 a privileged helper, or a change the user did not choose.
